## Quick Checklist Before Submitting Code

- [ ] Access modifiers explicit, fields named with `m_`, constants `c_`, statics `s_`.
- [ ] No per-frame allocations or LINQ in hot paths; pooled objects used where needed.
- [ ] `CompareTag` used; `GetComponent` calls cached; no `FindObjectOfType` in Update.
- [ ] Time usage correct (`deltaTime` vs `fixedDeltaTime`); physics in `FixedUpdate`.
- [ ] Addressables/asset lifecycles released; scenes managed additively if applicable.
- [ ] Logs concise and categorized; editor-only logs wrapped.
- [ ] Inspector is clean: headers, tooltips, and ranges applied.
- [ ] Tests or validation for core logic present when feasible.
